t walks the north corridor every weekday from 7 am till 8 am.\",\"line\":7,\"span\":\"The duty officer walks the north corridor every weekday from 7 am till 8 am, right after the shift handover.\"},{\"text\":\"The duty officer's north corridor round at the Millgate depot takes place right after the shift handover.\",\"line\":7,\"span\":\"The duty officer walks the north corridor every weekday from 7 am till 8 am, right after the shift handover.\"},{\"text\":\"A second round at the Millgate depot covers the workshop and the paint store.\",\"line\":8,\"span\":\"A second round covers the workshop and the paint store from 13:05 till 16:20 hours on Wednesdays only.\"},{\"text\":\"The second round at the Millgate depot runs from 13:05 till 16:20 hours on Wednesdays only.\",\"line\":8,\"span\":\"A second round covers the workshop and the paint store from 13:05 till 16:20 hours on Wednesdays only.\"},{\"text\":\"The site manager at the Millgate depot has asked for a third round for years.\",\"line\":8,\"span\":\"The site manager has asked for a third round for years\"},{\"text\":\"The budget at the Millgate depot has never allowed a third round.\",\"line\":8,\"span\":\"but the budget has never allowed it\"},{\"text\":\"Frost swells the timber frames on the older doors at the Millgate depot.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"Frost swells the timber frames on the older doors\"},{\"text\":\"Between November and February several of the older doors at the Millgate depot will not latch unless pulled hard.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"so between November and February several of them will not latch unless pulled hard\"},{\"text\":\"Once the frames dry out in spring, the older doors at the Millgate depot close cleanly again.\",\"line\":13,\"span\":\"Once the frames dry out in spring, the same doors close cleanly again.\"},{\"text\":\"The fire doors at the Millgate depot are the responsibility of the site.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"While the doors are the responsibility of the site, the certified inspection is carried out by an outside contractor who attends every March 1st to March 31st.\"},{\"text\":\"The certified inspection of the fire doors at the Millgate depot is carried out by an outside contractor.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"While the doors are the responsibility of the site, the certified inspection is carried out by an outside contractor who attends every March 1st to March 31st.\"},{\"text\":\"The outside contractor attends the Millgate depot every March 1st to March 31st.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"While the doors are the responsibility of the site, the certified inspection is carried out by an outside contractor who attends every March 1st to March 31st.\"},{\"text\":\"During the visit the contractor tags each fire door at the Millgate depot.\",\"line\":18,\"span\":\"During that visit the contractor tags each door, photographs the closer, and leaves a signed certificate at the gatehouse for the auditors.\"},{\"text\":\"During the visit the contractor photographs the closer of each fire door at the Millgate depot.\",\"line\":18,\"span\":\"During that visit the contractor tags each door, photographs the closer, and leaves a signed certificate at the gatehouse for the auditors.\"},{\"text\":\"During the visit the contractor leaves a signed certificate at the gatehouse for the auditors.\",\"line\":18,\"span\":\"During that visit the contractor tags each door, photographs the closer, and leaves a signed certificate at the gatehouse for the auditors.\"},{\"text\":\"At the Millgate depot, whoever finds a defect writes it in the log.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"It became custom that whoever finds a defect writes it in the log and pins a yellow card to the door itself.\"},{\"text\":\"At the Millgate depot, whoever finds a defect pins a yellow card to the door itself.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"It became custom that whoever finds a defect writes it in the log and pins a yellow card to the door itself.\"},{\"text\":\"The yellow card stays on the door until the repair is signed off.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"The card stays there until the repair is signed off.\"},{\"text\":\"Staff at the Millgate depot have started betting on whether the yellow card or the written record is cleared first.\",\"line\":23,\"span\":\"Staff have started betting on whether the card or the written record is cleared first.\"},{\"text\":\"In most cases the yellow card and the written record are cleared at the same time.\",\"line\":24,\"span\":\"In most cases it is a tie, because one officer clears both at the end of the week.\"},{\"text\":\"One officer clears both the yellow card and the written record at the end of the week.\",\"line\":24,\"span\":\"In most cases it is a tie, because one officer clears both at the end of the week.\"}]}","ttft_ms":12322,"type":"result","duration_ms":12360,"uuid":"01b13c4d-dd5d-493c-b7fd-bf9e69319668","ttft_stream_ms":1531,"time_to_request_ms":66,"first_content_frame_ms":1531,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
